      {
        "id": 97470,
        "name": "Reckless",
        "username": "Reckless",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-03T03:23:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"imprimis5\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/imprimis5/48/2387_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> imprimis5:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>jagarciao wrote:</b><br><blockquote>&nbsp;Ironic wrote:<br><blockquote>.\"You know what I do want to know, though? &nbsp;What would people in the universe of Sentinels comics call \"heroes who inherited their names from other heroes\" (the Bunkers are the main non-Parsons example I know of, but there could be others). &nbsp;Surely, calling such a person a \"legacy\" would just get confusing, yes?&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\nScions\n</blockquote></div>\nYeah! After the ill-fated White Wolf RPG!\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>They're working on the second edition!&nbsp; That game had such a fun world…<br><br>As for future deities in GSF…Ra?&nbsp; Seriously…if the Metahumans worshipped Sun Ra then we would have some hardcore parallels to afrofuturism which would be absolutely fantastic.&nbsp; Almaric jamming to \"Things You Can Do\" by Deltron 3030 is firmly locked in my headcanon.<br><br>But something may have happened to the Legacy line by the time GSF happens?&nbsp; Rough…</p>",
        "post_number": 79,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:24:51.292Z",
