        "created_at": "2014-04-04T00:05:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Reckless\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/48/2467_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Reckless:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>But something may have happened to the Legacy line by the time GSF happens?&nbsp; Rough…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Not necessarily. If America ceased to exist for whatever reason any Legacies running around might end up being depowered.</p>",
