        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TheSoundOfTrees\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TheSoundOfTrees:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I can't wait to see what Christopher has in store for the End of the Legacy Line.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Maybe something leaves her unable to have children? That would effectivly end the line</p>",
